OL,3,ADolly Parton, country music icon and
OL,4,Alegendary philanthropist, dies aged 80
OL,5,
OL,6,FRaised in poverty in a one-room cabin
OL,7,Fin the Smoky Mountains of Tennessee,
OL,8,FParton was the fourth youngest of 12
OL,9,Fchildren - her early life in pictures
OL,11,FParton's style was unapologetically
OL,12,Fbold, she wowed Glastonbury, starred in
OL,13,Fwell-known films and appealed to all
OL,14,Fages
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/18
