OL,3,ADolly Parton: A life in pictures
OL,4,
OL,5,FDolly Parton: A life in pictures
OL,7,FDolly Parton, the country music
OL,8,Fsuperstar from the Smoky Mountains of
OL,9,FTennessee, rose from humble beginnings
OL,10,Fto become one of the most beloved
OL,11,Fentertainers in the world.
OL,13,FOver a career spanning more than 60
OL,14,Fyears, she sold more than 100 million
OL,15,Frecords, wrote more than 3,000 songs
OL,16,Fand won 11 Grammy Awards, including a
OL,17,Flifetime achievement honour.
OL,19,FYet she has always described herself
OL,20,Ffirst and foremost as a songwriter.
OL,21,F"It's my way of expressing myself. It's
OL,22,Fmy therapy," she once said.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/18
